05:46.763 --> 05:47.847
Jij hier?

05:48.389 --> 05:49.515
Beom-seok.

05:50.475 --> 05:51.559
Lang niet gezien.

05:53.728 --> 05:55.730
Ja, inderdaad.

05:56.731 --> 05:59.025
